{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/7ac8e9def4b5c91f838b84602a8b2e20.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the shadows of the Ancient Era. The Primal Vanquisher pack grants you power drawn not only from beast and earth\u2014but from the dark rites whispered by those who walked alone in the wild. Cloaked in feathers, bone, and rune-marked steel, you stride the path of the hunter, the seer, and the soulbound.<br> <br> <i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> and includes all items from the Traveler and Templar packs, along with unique <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This Pack also contains the following Supporter Packs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/e25074af7b280c01c9491a2db9ec281b.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Primal Templar Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/a4184be47e506a7ba534809cb14c5c7b.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following items are unique to the Primal Vanquisher - Supporter Pack:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>200 Epoch Points (EP)</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Digital currency to further customize your journey. Use these points to purchase additional cosmetics from the in-game cosmetic shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/f5b8a238bcdc173831893b36941b7e0e.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carrion Caster\u2019s Cape</strong> <i>(Backslot Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tattered and worn, this dark robe drapes low, bearing a rune-carved shield adorned with crow feathers. The crimson sigil shines faintly, as if the winds themselves remember the rites it once witnessed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/337d805d6c8dda3ef9c331d14b0dac86.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Ritual Portal</strong> <i>(Portal Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth, consecrated. The sacrifice, complete. Devout followers of sinister and forgotten magics open a dark threshold for you to cross. But what of your return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/b9ab6a423733a450435ce089f658721a.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carrion Caster</strong> <i>(2H Staff Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound in blackened wood and cold iron, this staff is crowned by a carrion mask and ringed in ritual claws. Red energy flickers in the recesses of the carved skull\u2014magic born of blood, sky, and sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/2bebf9c06ef4c11943d24ddcf93633c6.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carrion Herald</strong> <i>(Armor Set Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clad in dark robes and plated with ritual steel, the Carrion Herald carries the weight of prophecy and battle. Crow skulls and rune-branded metal echo the balance between death\u2019s wisdom and nature\u2019s fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/6d6444494d8b76a80dd9a31e3297fd2e.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Pursuit Evade</strong> <i>(Evade Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your escape is marked by ribbons of dark crimson energy that fracture and crackle behind you\u2014like a spell breaking free from a sealed tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/8d54f8719b1a1b48da70dc08ac018e38.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ritual Footprints</strong> <i>(Footprint Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step carves glowing runes into the earth\u2014sigils of an ancient language long buried, now etched again by your passage through the timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/521f7bfe5ad04d7370429417fa0b1004.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your dominion with the mark of the Vanquisher\u2014wrought in old script and inked in red, it signifies mastery of both nature and the forgotten forces beneath it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/e24512b7b0eba95e1add145cbda0bc26.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=291 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865740?t=1755012596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865740?t=1755012596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/2cef3aa09cf7daf2b79bef3cfe706b25572d81c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755012596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/2cef3aa09cf7daf2b79bef3cfe706b25572d81c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755012596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher - Supporter Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/7ac8e9def4b5c91f838b84602a8b2e20.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 