Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clad in dark robes and plated with ritual steel, the Carrion Herald carries the weight of prophecy and battle. Crow skulls and rune-branded metal echo the balance between death\u2019s wisdom and nature\u2019s fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/6d6444494d8b76a80dd9a31e3297fd2e.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Pursuit Evade</strong> <i>(Evade Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your escape is marked by ribbons of dark crimson energy that fracture and crackle behind you\u2014like a spell breaking free from a sealed tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/8d54f8719b1a1b48da70dc08ac018e38.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ritual Footprints</strong> <i>(Footprint Effect Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each step carves glowing runes into the earth\u2014sigils of an ancient language long buried, now etched again by your passage through the timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865740/extras/521f7bfe5ad04d7370429417fa0b1004.avif?t=1755012596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Vanquisher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your dominion with the mark of the Vanquisher\u2014wrought in old script and inked in red, it signifies mastery of both nature and the forgotte